    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/6136fecebea344318b31bbd3c4cf4986.avif?t=1748001773\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cHow does immortality taste?<br>Depends on the price.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And trust me,<br>You will pay.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><br>See, friend\u2026<br>Guys like me don\u2019t roll the dice<br>Unless they\u2019re rigged.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ghostly warship prowls the fog, hunting and devouring anything in its path. Trapped aboard the cursed <i>Zombie Ship</i>, you must survive its relentless nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore its decaying halls, battle grotesque horrors, and witness brutal naval battles as the ship wages war against the living. Escape is a battle you may not win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cinematic horror adventure of survival, terror, and relentless pursuit, with immersive sequences that pull you deeper into the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STORYLINE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost at sea, you find refuge on a derelict warship. But this is no sanctuary. The <i>Zombie Ship</i> - a massive predator driven by its unread crew\u2014hunts anything it encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the storm-tossed void, it rips apart vessels, shattering masts and devouring ships whole. You must unravel its cursed past before it claims you next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEY FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Warship That Hunts</strong> \u2013 The <i>Zombie Ship</i> is a relentless predator, tearing through vessels and consuming anyone in its wake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unreal Engine 5 Horror</strong> \u2013 A dark, stunning world where the ocean feels alive, and the ship\u2019s cursed corridors pulse with dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal Combat</strong> \u2013 Face monstrous horrors and undead sailors in visceral, heart-pounding  melee and ranged combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Experiences</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in gripping, film-quality sequences that amplify the terror and pull you deeper into the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysteries to Solve</strong> \u2013 Unlock secrets, solve cryptic riddles, and uncover the ship\u2019s dark fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Terror</strong> \u2013 Will you retain your humanity, or become part of the ship\u2019s unread crew?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deep is calling. Will you answer? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong><i>Zombie Ship</i></strong> to your wishlist now and be the first to experience this relentless horror.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628400/extras/6136fecebea344318b31bbd3c4cf4986.avif?t=1748001773\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cHow does immortality taste?<br>Depends on the price.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And trust me,<br>You will pay.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><br>See, friend\u2026<br>Guys like me don\u2019t roll the dice<br>Unless they\u2019re rigged.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ghostly warship prowls the fog, hunting and devouring anything in its path. Trapped aboard the cursed <i>Zombie Ship</i>, you must survive its relentless nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore its decaying halls, battle grotesque horrors, and witness brutal naval battles as the ship wages war against the living. Escape is a battle you may not win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cinematic horror adventure of survival, terror, and relentless pursuit, with immersive sequences that pull you deeper into the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STORYLINE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost at sea, you find refuge on a derelict warship. But this is no sanctuary. The <i>Zombie Ship</i> - a massive predator driven by its unread crew\u2014hunts anything it encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the storm-tossed void, it rips apart vessels, shattering masts and devouring ships whole. You must unravel its cursed past before it claims you next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEY FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Warship That Hunts</strong> \u2013 The <i>Zombie Ship</i> is a relentless predator, tearing through vessels and consuming anyone in its wake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unreal Engine 5 Horror</strong> \u2013 A dark, stunning world where the ocean feels alive, and the ship\u2019s cursed corridors pulse with dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal Combat</strong> \u2013 Face monstrous horrors and undead sailors in visceral, heart-pounding  melee and ranged combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Experiences</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in gripping, film-quality sequences that amplify the terror and pull you deeper into the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysteries to Solve</strong> \u2013 Unlock secrets, solve cryptic riddles, and uncover the ship\u2019s dark fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Terror</strong> \u2013 Will you retain your humanity, or become part of the ship\u2019s unread crew?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deep is calling. Will you answer? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong><i>Zombie Ship</i></strong> to your wishlist now and be the first to experience this relentless horror.</p>",
